## Validate

Run `python ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/validate.py <output>`. Exit 0 means done. Exit 1 lists
what failed: fix those items and run it again, at most [[FILL: a small retry limit]] times. Still
failing after that, or exit 2 (bad input): stop and report the script's output and what you tried.

## Report

